# Generated artefacts. The board is 30 MB of copper and the router jar is 58 MB;
# both are reproducible from the scripts beside this file (see README.md).
*.kicad_pcb
*.kicad_pro
*.kicad_dru
*.dsn
*.ses
*.jar
*.log
*.drc*.json
*.contract.json
*.svg
*.png
*.lck
frjar/

# ...except the finished boards in out/, which are the point of the exercise.
# These are tracked so an online viewer (KiCanvas et al.) can open them straight
# from GitHub. That is also why they are NOT in Git LFS: a raw GitHub URL on an
# LFS file serves the pointer stub, not the board, and the viewer sees nothing.
#
# A directory negation cannot rescue a file an extension rule already excluded,
# so these have to name the files themselves.
!out/*.kicad_pcb
!out/*.kicad_pro
!out/*.kicad_dru

# The renders stay out: 144 MB of PNG that the board files above already say.
